      "en": "World of Warcraft: Forever is Now Live",
      "es": "World of Warcraft: Forever ya está disponible"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "World of Warcraft: Forever is Now Live...",
      "es": "World of Warcraft: Forever ya está disponible..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6aebc3e228c6b7.49302393\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\"><div class=\"pad exclude-units\"></div><div class=\"pad exclude-units\"></div><div class=\"\" style=\"max-width:600px; margin:20px auto; font-family:Arial;\"><div class=\"first last\" style=\"border:2px solid #8c1515; border-radius:10px; background:rgba(120,41,41,0.05); overflow:visible; position:relative; padding-top:20px;\"><div class=\"first\" style=\"display:inline-block; background:#8c1515; color:white; font-weight:bold; padding:5px 14px; border-radius:8px; position:absolute; top:-18px; left:12px;\">More Information:</div><div class=\"last\" style=\"padding:12px; line-height:1.5; font-size:15px; display:inline-block;\">If you are at a screen where Gameplay Rulesets are showing as unavailable, you need to requeue. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1307244.png\" id=\"1307244\"><img width=\"600\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1307244.png?maxWidth=600\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"rulesets\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.96753 / 1;\"></a></div></div></div></div>World of Warcraft: Forever is now live! Enjoy your Journey through Azeroth. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/wowheads-forever-tools-now-live-and-updated-for-launch-383722\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Wowhead Tools</span></a><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/every-guide-youll-need-for-launch-the-wow-forever-guide-compendium-383727\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Wowhead Guides Compendium</span></a></div><br><br>WoW: Forever is now officially live in all regions! Enjoy a reimagined Azeroth full of new zones, quests, professions, classes, and so much more. Stay tuned to Wowhead for any queue times and known issues with the game as the launch day continues. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1307239.png\" id=\"1307239\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1307239.png?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.77778 / 1;\"></a></div><br><br>Make sure to check out all of <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/wowheads-forever-tools-now-live-and-updated-for-launch-383722\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Wowhead's Tools for WoW: Forever</a> and <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/every-guide-youll-need-for-launch-the-wow-forever-guide-compendium-383727\" data-contiguous=\"true\">all of Wowhead's Guides</a> which will be updated as we learn more about the changes in Azeroth.<h2 id=\"wow-forever-queue-time-updates\" class=\"heading-size-2 heading-bar\"><span data-markup-content-target=\"1\">WoW: Forever Queue Time Updates</span></h2><b>3:10 PST:</b> Queue times are stated to be about 5-10 minutes for most players, with many reporting between 1500-4000 as their queue position. That said, getting through the queue has presented many with unavailable rulesets.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1307245.jpg\" id=\"1307245\"><img width=\"600\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1307245.jpg?maxWidth=600\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"queue times\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 2.26944 / 1;\"></a></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>More Information:<br />If you are at a screen where Gameplay Rulesets are showing as unavailable, you need to requeue. <br /><br />World of Warcraft: Forever is now live! Enjoy your Journey through Azeroth. <br /><br />Wowhead ToolsWowhead Guides Compendium<br /><br />WoW: Forever is now officially live in all regions! Enjoy a reimagined Azeroth full of new zones, quests, professions, classes, and so much more. Stay tuned to Wowhead for any queue times and known issues with the game as the launch day continues. <br /><br />Make sure to check out all of <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/wowheads-forever-tools-now-live-and-updated-for-launch-383722\">Wowhead's Tools for WoW: Forever</a> and <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/every-guide-youll-need-for-launch-the-wow-forever-guide-compendium-383727\">all of Wowhead's Guides</a> which will be updated as we learn more about the changes in Azeroth.<br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">WoW: Forever Queue Time Updates</h2><br /><br /><b>3:10 PST:</b> Queue times are stated to be about 5-10 minutes for most players, with many reporting between 1500-4000 as their queue position. That said, getting through the queue has presented many with unavailable rulesets.<br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
