    "title": {
      "en": "Secret Twitch Drop Awarded Pouch of Violet Dust Toy to Live Stream Viewers in WoW: Forever",
      "es": "Secret Twitch Drop recibe una bolsa de juguete de polvo violeta para transmitir en vivo a los espectadores en WoW: Forever"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Secret Twitch Drop Awarded Pouch of Violet Dust Toy to Live Stream Viewers in WoW: Forever...",
      "es": "Secret Twitch Drop recibió una bolsa de juguete de polvo violeta para transmitir en vivo a los espectadores en WoW: Forever..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6aebc4b674eb39.14684166\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Players who watched the Legendary crafting stream on Twitch have been awarded a Pouch of Violet Dust Toy via Twitch Drops!<br><br>If you watched the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/taldramir-the-whispering-wood-revealed-as-wow-forever-legendary-383747\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Legendary crafting stream</a> earlier today, you may have been awarded a <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/drops/inventory\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">new Twitch drop</a>. In the last few moments of the stream, when <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/taldramir-the-whispering-wood-revealed-as-wow-forever-legendary-383747\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Taldramir, the Whispering Wood was revealed</a>, players completed a Twitch Drop that awarded <a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=289439/pouch-of-violet-dust\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Pouch of Violet Dust\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_12_tailoring_reagent_bag_violet_reagent_bag.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Pouch of Violet Dust</span></a>! If you completed this, head to your <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/drops/inventory\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Twitch drop</a> and claim your prize!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span data-markup-tooltip-container=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\" class=\"wowhead-tooltip-inline exclude-units wowhead-tooltip-inline-icon\"><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip wowhead-tooltip-width-restriction wowhead-tooltip-width-320\" data-game=\"wow\" data-tree=\"classicplus\" data-env=\"classicplus\" data-type=\"item\" data-visible=\"yes\" style=\"width: 320px; visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"whtt-tooltip-icon\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"iconmedium\" data-env=\"classicplus\" data-tree=\"classicplus\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\"><ins class=\"lazy-load-background\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_12_tailoring_reagent_bag_violet_reagent_bag.jpg&quot;);\"></ins><del></del></div></div><table><tbody><tr><td><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--nstart--><b class=\"q3\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=289439/pouch-of-violet-dust\" data-disable-wowhead-tooltip=\"true\">Pouch of Violet Dust</a></b><!--nend--><!--ndstart--><!--ndend--><span class=\"q whtt-extra whtt-ilvl\"><br>Item Level <!--ilvl-->1</span><!--bo--><br>Binds when picked up<!--ue--><!--ue--><br><span class=\"toycolor\">Toy</span><!--ebstats--><!--egstats--><!--eistats--><!--nameDescStats--></td></tr></tbody></table><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--useText:0:1--><span id=\"useText1\" class=\"q2\">Use: <!--useEffect:0:1--><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/spell=1328348/throw-violet-dust\" class=\"q2\">Throw a handful into the campfire, transforming its flames.<br><span style=\"color: #ffffff\">Requires WoW: Forever Launch Celebration </span></a> (30 Min Cooldown)<!--useEffect:1--></span><!--useText:1--><!--itemEffects:1--><br><span class=\"q\">\"Many gathered. Many watched.\"</span><br><!--pvpEquip--><!--pvpEquip--></td></tr></tbody></table></td><th style=\"background-position: right top;\"></th></tr><tr><th style=\"background-position: left bottom;\"></th><th style=\"background-position: right bottom;\"></th></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip-powered\"></div></div></span></div><br><br><b>It's unknown what the exact criteria was to obtain this Twitch Drop.</b> Many players reported getting this item at the end of the Legendary Crafting stream, while others have reported getting it from any WoW streamer around the same time. In addition, the Drop Page has this listed with an End Date of Wednesday, November 4th at 1:59 PM PST /<wbr> 4:59 PM EST. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1307238.png\" id=\"1307238\"><img width=\"400\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1307238.png?maxWidth=400\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Secret Twitch Drop\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 2.5229 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>As this time has now passed, this seems to indicate that this Twitch Drop is no longer available and was only given to players who watched any WoW stream when the Legendary reveal went live. It's unknown whether players can still get this Toy by watching the <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/warcraft\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Warcraft Twitch channel</a> or any other Twitch channel, as the exact requirements for obtaining this drop are still unknown.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>Players who watched the Legendary crafting stream on Twitch have been awarded a Pouch of Violet Dust Toy via Twitch Drops!<br /><br />If you watched the <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/taldramir-the-whispering-wood-revealed-as-wow-forever-legendary-383747\">Legendary crafting stream</a> earlier today, you may have been awarded a <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/drops/inventory\" rel=\"nofollow\">new Twitch drop</a>. In the last few moments of the stream, when <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/taldramir-the-whispering-wood-revealed-as-wow-forever-legendary-383747\">Taldramir, the Whispering Wood was revealed</a>, players completed a Twitch Drop that awarded <a href=\"/forever/item=289439/pouch-of-violet-dust\">Pouch of Violet Dust</a>! If you completed this, head to your <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/drops/inventory\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitch drop</a> and claim your prize!<br /><br /><b>It's unknown what the exact criteria was to obtain this Twitch Drop.</b> Many players reported getting this item at the end of the Legendary Crafting stream, while others have reported getting it from any WoW streamer around the same time. In addition, the Drop Page has this listed with an End Date of Wednesday, November 4th at 1:59 PM PST / 4:59 PM EST. <br /><br />As this time has now passed, this seems to indicate that this Twitch Drop is no longer available and was only given to players who watched any WoW stream when the Legendary reveal went live. It's unknown whether players can still get this Toy by watching the <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/warcraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Warcraft Twitch channel</a> or any other Twitch channel, as the exact requirements for obtaining this drop are still unknown.</noscript>            \n        ",
    "imageUrl": "https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/56015-secret-twitch-drop-awards-pouch-of-violet-dust-toy-in-wow-forever.png",
