    "id": "wh-383741",
    "source": "wowhead",
    "dateRaw": "Wed, 04 Nov 2026 13:38:53 -0600",
    "author": "Wowhead Staff",
    "category": "Live",
    "badgeColor": "border-amber-500/60 bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-300",
    "title": {
      "en": "WoW: Forever Development Notes Updated - UI and Accessibility Updates",
      "es": "WoW: Actualización de las notas de desarrollo de Forever: actualizaciones de la interfaz de usuario y la accesibilidad"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "WoW: Forever Development Notes Updated - UI and Accessibility Updates...",
      "es": "WoW: Notas de desarrollo de Forever actualizadas - Actualizaciones de interfaz de usuario y accesibilidad..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6aebc4026539b5.05964237\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has updated WoW: Forever Development notes before the official launch, adding new updates for UI and accessibility.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2360696/10\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">We’ve added this section to the previous post.<br><br><b>User Interface and Accessibility</b><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Swing Timer bar will no longer fade out due to distance until the swing finishes.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">When combined bag is enabled, the background art of the inventory slots are updated to show which bag the slot is from.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Fixed an issue where Nameplates did not display Elite enemy status.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Debuff icons on the Nameplate can now be clicked through.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Spellbook and Talents frame now opens at the same height as other panels.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Combat mode for the Spellbook frame has been reduced in size.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">PvP scoreboard display has been updated.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Killing a player while at Honor cap will no longer show honor gained in floating text or chat messages.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">While in keybinds menu, hovering over an action bar keybind will now highlight the button on the action bar.</div></li></ul></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has updated WoW: Forever Development notes before the official launch, adding new updates for UI and accessibility. <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">We’ve added this section to the previous post.<br /><br /><b>User Interface and Accessibility</b><br /><br /><ul><li>Swing Timer bar will no longer fade out due to distance until the swing finishes.</li><li>When combined bag is enabled, the background art of the inventory slots are updated to show which bag the slot is from.</li><li>Fixed an issue where Nameplates did not display Elite enemy status.</li><li>Debuff icons on the Nameplate can now be clicked through.</li><li>Spellbook and Talents frame now opens at the same height as other panels.</li><li>Combat mode for the Spellbook frame has been reduced in size.</li><li>PvP scoreboard display has been updated.</li><li>Killing a player while at Honor cap will no longer show honor gained in floating text or chat messages.</li><li>While in keybinds menu, hovering over an action bar keybind will now highlight the button on the action bar.</li></ul></div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
    "imageUrl": "https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/56008-wow-forever-development-notes-updated-ui-and-accessibility-updates.jpg",
