    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6aebc3ee420348.95124072\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">For the month of November, if you sub to a WoW streamer on Twitch, you can claim new Horde and Alliance chat badges!<br><br>World of Warcraft: Forever launches today and if you're watching on Twitch, you can show off your Faction Pride with new chat badges. These are available until the end of the month on November 30th and require you to sub or gift a sub to a WoW streamer.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units\" data-type=\"user\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\"><a href=\"https://x.com/Twitch/status/2118044097629815083\" target=\"_blank\">Twitch</a><span class=\"quote-said-text\"> said: </span></div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a class=\"quote-header-link\" href=\"https://x.com/Twitch/status/2118044097629815083\" target=\"_blank\">Link</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">For the Horde or For the Alliance?<br><br>Wear your colours proudly with chat badges dropping today with the launch of WoW Forever.<br><br>Sub or gift to your favourite WoW streamer from today through midnight 11/<wbr>30 to claim yours.</div></div><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"markup-bluetweet exclude-units\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/wowheadtweets/status/2118044097629815083\">Tweet #2118044097629815083</a></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>For the month of November, if you sub to a WoW streamer on Twitch, you can claim new Horde and Alliance chat badges!<br /><br />World of Warcraft: Forever launches today and if you're watching on Twitch, you can show off your Faction Pride with new chat badges. These are available until the end of the month on November 30th and require you to sub or gift a sub to a WoW streamer.<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\">For the Horde or For the Alliance?<br /><br />Wear your colours proudly with chat badges dropping today with the launch of WoW Forever.<br /><br />Sub or gift to your favourite WoW streamer from today through midnight 11/30 to claim yours.</div><br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
